@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #EAF3EC
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #17664D
actor "Cashier" as Cashier
actor "Owner / manager" as Owner
actor "Customer\n(WhatsApp)" as Customer
rectangle "Cella — target MVP user workflows" {
  usecase "Manage product catalog\n(storage exists; screen planned)" as Products
  usecase "Receive / adjust stock\n(service exists; screen planned)" as Stock
  usecase "Record cash sale\n(service exists; screen planned)" as Sale
  usecase "Deduct stock atomically\n(implemented)" as Deduct
  usecase "View movement history\n(service exists)" as History
  usecase "Login and enforce roles\n(planned)" as Login
  usecase "Record credit / repayment\n(planned)" as Debt
  usecase "Void sale with audit trail\n(planned)" as Void
  usecase "Generate PDF receipt\n(planned)" as Receipt
  usecase "Back up / restore data\n(planned)" as Backup
  usecase "View owner dashboard\n(planned)" as Dashboard
  usecase "Ask availability / price\n(planned)" as Ask
}
Cashier --> Sale
Cashier --> Debt
Cashier --> Login
Cashier --> Receipt
Owner --> Login
Owner --> Products
Owner --> Stock
Owner --> History
Owner --> Void
Owner --> Backup
Owner --> Dashboard
Customer --> Ask
Sale ..> Deduct : <<include>>
note bottom of Sale
Cash-only backend exists today.
No production cashier workflow or
role enforcement is implied by this view.
end note
note bottom of Void
Final owner/cashier permission matrix
must be agreed before implementation.
end note
@enduml
